### Extended Catalog Finding

#### 10. Assertion Roulette (Extended Smell)
**Test:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (line 69)
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount);   // no message
Assert.AreEqual(22.28m,  order.TaxAmount);     // no message
Assert.AreEqual(269.78m, order.GrandTotal);    // no message
```
**Problem:** 3 assertions, zero explanatory messages. A failure reports only `"Expected: 247.50, Actual: 240.00"` — which amount concept failed?
**Fix:** Add message parameters:
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount, "Subtotal mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(22.28m,  order.TaxAmount,   "Tax mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(269.78m, order.GrandTotal,   "Grand total mismatch");
```

