## Smell-Free Pattern ✨

**`ValidateOrder_NullOrder_ThrowsArgumentNullException`** (line 155) is well-structured:
- Uses `Assert.ThrowsException<T>` (no manual try/catch)
- Asserts on a specific property (`ex.ParamName`)
- Single clear behavior under test
- No magic numbers, no external dependencies

This is the pattern the rest of the suite should follow.

